# --- Documentation stays out of version control (commit only on explicit request, via git add -f) ---
*.md
# No trailing slash: these must also match the symlinks that parallel-lane
# worktrees use to reach the (untracked) standards and docs in the main
# checkout. A trailing slash matches directories only, leaving the symlink
# itself showing as untracked in every lane.
docs
Design language for Nix review/

# Per-checkout list of paths scripts/new-goal-worktree.sh links into a lane.
# Untracked by nature: it names what this checkout has and the repository does
# not carry.
.worktree-links

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

